tems to distract enemies and sneak past them\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026 or just use flamethrower to scare them away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh items idea</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343620/extras/cf8b13774bd066bacc3a78aa7bbe5f56.poster.avif?t=1771506660\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343620/extras/cf8b13774bd066bacc3a78aa7bbe5f56.webm?t=1771506660\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343620/extras/cf8b13774bd066bacc3a78aa7bbe5f56.mp4?t=1771506660\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since Nemesis is not a shooter, don\u2019t expect too many weapons. Instead, you will have a different \u201carsenal\u201d \u2013 noise detector, hacking tool or good-old pipe will come in handy in various situations.</p>","developers":["Awaken Realms","Ovid Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343620/header.jpg?t=1771506660","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1343620/472055/09f8a0a556d63e94b11b74a6bd58fd431f1a0f9f/1751224320/dash_av1.mpd?t=1655234035","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1343620/472055/09f8a0a556d63e94b11b74a6bd58fd